## 📊 Pre-Packaged Benchmark Datasets

The repository includes **6 realistic datasets** located in `sample_data/` covering different market lending conditions:

| # | Dataset File | Format | Records | Scenario & Mining Characteristics |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **1** | `sample_1_standard_loan_data.csv` | **CSV** | **655 rows** | **Balanced Benchmark**: Standard Kaggle distribution with ~68% approval rate, standard demographic spreads, and verified credit histories. |
| **2** | `sample_2_commercial_enterprise_loans.xlsx` | **Excel (.xlsx)** | **1,205 rows** | **Commercial Lending**: High applicant incomes ($8k–$35k) and requested loan sizes ($200k+) in corporate urban centers. |
| **3** | `sample_3_subprime_high_risk_loans.csv` | **CSV** | **755 rows** | **Subprime Market**: Macroeconomic stress scenario with elevated rejection rates (~52%), defaults, and lower credit ratings. |
| **4** | `sample_4_tech_urban_graduates.csv` | **CSV** | **605 rows** | **Tech Professionals**: 96% Graduate rate, 70% Urban property location, high income-to-loan ratios, and accelerated loan tenures. |
| **5** | `sample_5_rural_microfinance_loans.xlsx` | **Excel (.xlsx)** | **855 rows** | **Rural Microfinance**: 75% Rural property location with micro-lending amounts ($15k–$120k) and agricultural self-employed borrowers. |
| **6** | `sample_6_messy_noisy_benchmark.csv` | **CSV** | **968 rows** | **Data Mining Stress-Test**: Contains 18 duplicate rows, 14% missing values, and extreme outliers up to $80,000 to test preprocessing. |

