## 🔌 REST API Usage

You can also request real-time underwriting predictions programmatically:

### Endpoint: `POST /api/predict/`

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "Gender": "Male",
  "Married": "Yes",
  "Dependents": "1",
  "Education": "Graduate",
  "Self_Employed": "No",
  "ApplicantIncome": 6500,
  "CoapplicantIncome": 2200,
  "LoanAmount": 150,
  "Loan_Amount_Term": 360,
  "Credit_History": 1.0,
  "Property_Area": "Semiurban"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "result": {
    "is_approved": true,
    "status": "Approved",
    "confidence": 99.86,
    "approval_probability": 99.86,
    "rejection_probability": 0.14,
    "positive_factors": [
      "Applicant has a verified, positive credit history record (major approval factor).",
      "Strong debt-to-income buffer: Total monthly income ($8,700) supports loan amount ($150,000).",
      "Higher educational attainment favorable for applicant stability."
    ],
    "risk_factors": [],
    "model_used": "Logistic Regression"
  }
}
```

